{"id":"d88d5d86db02e1a1","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure.md","title":"有界量词不增加算术层级","display":"thm-bounded-quantifier-closure — 有界量词不增加算术层级","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure","aliases":["20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure"],"display":"thm-bounded-quantifier-closure — 有界量词不增加算术层级","chapter":"4","section":"4.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.1.4(vi)","source_printed_pages":[81,82],"source_pdf_pages":[117,118],"depends_on":["[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bounded-quantifier-closure — 有界量词不增加算术层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.1.4(vi)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>81</span><span>82</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span><span>118</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge0\">\\(n\\ge0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}\">\\(\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\">\\(\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全可计算。有限自然数序列通过 seqcode 编成自然数，断言和证明中的序列量词均按这一有效双射展开。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{\\vec x:\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}\">\\(A=\\{\\vec x:\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{\\vec x:\\exists z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}\">\\(B=\\{\\vec x:\\exists z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bounded-quantifier-closure}\\vdash\n(R\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k})\\land\n(R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bounded-quantifier-closure}\\vdash\n(R\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k})\\land\n(R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 是有限循环求值。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 关系，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\vec x,z)\\iff\\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)\">\\(R(\\vec x,z)\\iff\\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\Pi_{n-1}\">\\(S\\in\\Pi_{n-1}\\)</span>。有界存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 合并为一个存在块，范围条件进入可计算矩阵，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Sigma_n\">\\(B\\in\\Sigma_n\\)</span>。有界全称的等价式是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ \\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [|t|=h(\\vec x)\\land\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ S(\\vec x,z,t(z))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ \\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [|t|=h(\\vec x)\\land\\forall z&lt;h(\\vec x)\\ S(\\vec x,z,t(z))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限见证列的存在由有限选择给出；右侧内部有界全称由归纳假设仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n-1}\">\\(\\Pi_{n-1}\\)</span>，所以整个公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 情形对补集应用刚证的两种操作，再取补集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\vec x)=0\">\\(h(\\vec x)=0\\)</span> 时空全称为真、空存在为假；编码空序列保持等价。不能把无界数目的独立存在见证直接缩成一个普通数而遗漏有限列编码。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 81–82 / PDF 117–118。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega^k\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\{\\vec x:\\forall z<h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\{\\vec x:\\exists z<h(\\vec x)\\ R(\\vec x,z)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}bounded-quantifier-closure}\\vdash\n(R\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n,k})\\land\n(R\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k}).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"R(\\vec x,z)\\iff\\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\Pi_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall z<h(\\vec x)\\ \\exists u\\ S(\\vec x,z,u)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\ [|t|=h(\\vec x)\\land\\forall z<h(\\vec x)\\ S(\\vec x,z,t(z))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"h(\\vec x)=0","display":false}],"bytes":2223,"backlinks":[{"id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-complement]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]；see [[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]] — 章 4；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-bounded-quantifier-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["832f53dc90c8947a","9885f96cf9cb2fff","35073b74f84433b3"]}